-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T02:41:21+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-default-route/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-default-route/", "title": "config default-route\uff08\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30eb\u30fc\u30c8\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30d1\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\uff09", "content_html": "config default-route\uff08\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30eb\u30fc\u30c8\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30d1\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u306b config default-route \u3068\u3044\u3046\u72ec\u7acb\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9\u306f\u5b58\u5728\u3057\u306a\u3044\u305f\u3081\u3001\u7528\u9014\u306b\u5fdc\u3058\u3066 vtysh / config route-map / frr \u8a2d\u5b9a\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u7b49\u3092\u4f7f\u3044\u5206\u3051\u308b\u30d1\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/config-default-route.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T02:41:21+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T08:13:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-pfc/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-pfc/", "title": "show pfc \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "show pfc \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 \u2014 show pfc \u306f PFC counter \u3068 PFC priority mapping \u3092\u8868\u793a\u3059\u308b CLI \u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u3002show pfcwd \u306f\u540c\u3058\u9818\u57df\u306e watchdog \u8868\u793a wrapper \u3067\u3001pfcwd show ... \u306b\u59d4\u8b72\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/show-pfc.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T02:41:21+00:00", "date_pu